00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:19.170
Uh, we know that Senate majority leader, Mitch
McConnell has multiple challengers.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.170
It's an uphill battle.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.800
It's going to be a tough one, but it's one
worth fighting.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.539
There's another interesting one, which is
South Carolina Republican Senator Lindsey

00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:28.400
