of South Carolina.

00:00:47.749 --> 00:00:52.030
He now has more than four point $6 million
on hand.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.820
Normal caveats here are very often in red
States.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:59.769
The democratic challengers are pretty centrist
establishment types.

00:00:59.769 --> 00:01:02.910
Jamie Harrison is a centrist establishment
type.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.610
He's a DNC official.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:11.430
Former chairman of the South Carolina DNC
campaign is backed by the DSCC.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:16.420
But this is still a good news because Lindsey
Graham has been one of the most vocal Trump

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.700
Brown nosers during the last 30 years.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:25.969
Culminating maybe with this absolutely unhinged
rant a, did I say 30 years?

00:01:25.969 --> 00:01:31.079
I met three years unhinged rant in support
of Donald Trump's often accused of sexual

00:01:31.079 --> 00:01:32.259
assault Supreme court.

