00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:20.900
Are you a gang rapist?

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:21.900
No.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:26.390
Yeah, so it would be a great accomplishment
to knock out Lindsey Graham.

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:28.310
It is a huge uphill battle.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:36.870
Back in 2014 in very red South Carolina, Lindsey
